menu "Deskimon hardware tests"
    config DSK_SPEAKER_TEST
        bool "Run speaker hardware test at boot (plays 440 Hz for 2 s then continues)"
        default n
        help
            When enabled, app_main() plays a 440 Hz sine wave through the PCM5101
            DAC (I2S1, GPIO 47/38/48) before starting the normal Deskimon application.
            Set to n for all production builds.
endmenu
